      "text": "(a) Write out the given expression using the difference of squares identity:\n\n\\[\n19^2 - 17^2 + 15^2 - 13^2 + 11^2 - 9^2 + 7^2 - 5^2 + 3^2 - 1^2\n\\]\n\n(b) Apply the identity \\(a^2 - b^2 = (a+b)(a-b)\\) step-by-step:\n\n\\[\n19^2 - 17^2 = (19+17)(19-17) = 36 \\cdot 2 = 72\n\\]\n\n\\[\n15^2 - 13^2 = (15+13)(15-13) = 28 \\cdot 2 = 56\n\\]\n\n\\[\n11^2 - 9^2 = (11+9)(11-9) = 20 \\cdot 2 = 40\n\\]\n\n\\[\n9^2 - 5^2 = (9+5)(9-5) = 14 \\cdot 4 = 56\n\\]\n\n\\[\n7^2 - 5^2 = (7+5)(7-5) = 12 \\cdot 2 = 24\n\\]\n\n\\[\n5^2 - 3^2 = (5+3)(5-3) = 8 \\cdot 2 = 16\n\\]\n\n\\[\n3^2 - 1^2 = (3+1)(3-1) = 4 \\cdot 2 = 8\n\\]\n\n(c) Sum all the results:\n\n\\[\n72 + 56 + 40 + 56 + 24 + 16 + 8\n\\]\n\n(d) Continue the addition:\n\n\\[\n72 + 56 = 128\n\\]\n\n\\[\n128 + 40 = 168\n\\]\n\n\\[\n168 + 56 = 224\n\\]\n\n\\[\n224 + 24 = 248\n\\]\n\n\\[\n248 + 16 = 264\n\\]\n\n\\[\n264 + 8 = 272\n\\]\n\nSo, the value of the expression is \\(\\boxed{272}\\).",
